      "description": "True AC wall power metered at the outlet by the Shelly plug (psu_total_power_watts via the gpu-exporter's /rpc/Switch.GetStatus poll). Reboot-proof and independent of the PSU's USB HID — the permanent wall-power source (see docs/operations/wall-power-metering.md). Compare with the DC-output stat beside it: wall − DC = PSU conversion loss."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "PSU DC Output — total (HX1500i)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1500,
          "unit": "watt",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 500
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 800
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1200
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_hwmon_power_watt{chip=~\".*1b1c.*\"} * on(chip, sensor) group_left(label) node_hwmon_sensor_label{label=\"power total\"}",
          "legendFormat": "DC total"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Total DC output power from the corsair-psu kernel driver via node_exporter hwmon. Pairs with the Shelly wall stat: wall − DC = conversion loss. (The driver's own input-power estimate reads garbage, hence the plug.)"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mains Voltage (Shelly, AC in)",
      "description": "True outlet voltage from the Shelly wall-plug meter \u2014 not a PSU-internal estimate. Dashed lines mirror the MainsVoltageLow / MainsVoltageCritical alert bands at 92% / 87% of a 120V nominal (110.4V / 104.4V). Those alert thresholds live in app_settings (prometheus.threshold.psu_nominal_line_voltage_volts and the two percent keys); if you retune them there, update these lines to match. Sustained undervoltage ends in an uncommanded hard power-off that leaves no journal entry \u2014 see docs/operations/wall-power-metering.md.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
